TI  - Some limits of the colored Jones polynomials of the figure-eight knot
DA  - D:20220524
UR  - https://arxiv.org/abs/math/0401084
AB  - We calculate limits of the colored Jones polynomials of the ﬁgure- eight knot and conclude that in most cases they determine the volumes and the Chern–Simons invariants of the three-manifolds obtained by Dehn surgeries along it.
